         <property name="text">
          <string>Unable to locate at least one GPG encryption key. KDE Wallet needs a GPG encryption key to securely store passwords or other sensitive data on disk. If you still want to setup a GPG-based wallet, exit this wizard, create an encryption key and return to this wizard. Otherwise, you can return to the previous page and select Blowfish encryption, which does not require an encryption key.</string>
